<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AirSync Systems — Smart Automations for Plumbing, Roofing & HVAC</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg-primary:#0a0e17;--bg-secondary:#0f1420;--bg-card:#141a28;--accent:#00e5a0;--accent-glow:rgba(0,229,160,.15);--accent-glow-strong:rgba(0,229,160,.3);--text-primary:#e8ecf4;--text-secondary:#8892a6;--text-dim:#5a6478;--border:rgba(255,255,255,.06);--border-accent:rgba(0,229,160,.2);--font-display:'Sora',sans-serif;--font-body:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;--font-mono:'DM Mono',monospace}
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg-primary);color:var(--text-primary);font-family:var(--font-body);line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.03'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");pointer-events:none;z-index:9999}
.grid-bg{position:fixed;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.015) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.015) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:60px 60px;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}

nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:1000;padding:1.25rem 3rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;backdrop-filter:blur(20px);background:rgba(10,14,23,.8);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.nav-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;text-decoration:none}
.nav-logo-icon{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#00b8d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1rem}
.nav-logo span{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--text-primary);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:2.5rem;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{color:var(--text-secondary);text-decoration:none;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;transition:color .3s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.nav-cta{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg-primary);padding:.6rem 1.5rem;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:.875rem;transition:all .3s;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.nav-cta:hover{background:#00f5b0;box-shadow:0 0 30px var(--accent-glow-strong)}

.hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:8rem 2rem 6rem;z-index:1}
.hero-glow{position:absolute;width:700px;height:700px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--accent-glow) 0%,transparent 70%);top:10%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);pointer-events:none;animation:pulseGlow 6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulseGlow{0%,100%{opacity:.5;transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1)}50%{opacity:.8;transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1.1)}}
.hero-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards .2s}
.hero-tag::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:blink 2s infinite}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:900px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards .4s}
.hero h1 .accent-text{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#00d4ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.hero-industries{display:flex;gap:.75rem;margin-bottom:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards .5s}
.industry-pill{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:100px;padding:.5rem 1.15rem;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500;transition:all .3s}
.industry-pill:hover{border-color:var(--border-accent);color:var(--accent)}
.hero p{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--text-secondary);max-width:620px;margin-bottom:2.5rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards .6s}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards .8s}
.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg-primary);padding:.85rem 2rem;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;transition:all .3s;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary:hover{background:#00f5b0;box-shadow:0 0 40px var(--accent-glow-strong);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--text-primary);padding:.85rem 2rem;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;border:1px solid var(--border);transition:all .3s;cursor:pointer}
.btn-secondary:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-glow)}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:3rem;margin-top:4rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease forwards 1s}
.hero-stat{text-align:center}
.hero-stat .number{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
.hero-stat .label{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-dim);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:.25rem}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}

section{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:7rem 2rem}
.section-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:4rem}
.section-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1rem;display:inline-block}
.section-header h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:1rem}
.section-header p{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.7}

.pain-points{background:var(--bg-secondary)}
.pain-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.pain-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:2rem 1.75rem;transition:all .4s}
.pain-card:hover{border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.3);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.pain-icon{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.pain-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.6rem;color:#f87171}
.pain-card p{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6}

.steps-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:2rem;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.step-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:2.5rem 2rem;position:relative;transition:all .4s;overflow:hidden}
.step-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),transparent);opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.step-card:hover{border-color:var(--border-accent);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.step-card:hover::before{opacity:1}
.step-number{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:3rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);opacity:.15;position:absolute;top:1rem;right:1.5rem}
.step-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--accent-glow);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.step-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.75rem}
.step-card p{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.65}

.workflow-section{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.workflow-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6rem;padding:3rem;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;transition:all .4s}
.workflow-card:hover{border-color:var(--border-accent);box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(0,229,160,.05)}
.workflow-card.reverse{direction:rtl}
.workflow-card.reverse>*{direction:ltr}
.workflow-info{padding:1rem}
.workflow-badge{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.7rem;color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-glow);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);padding:.35rem .85rem;border-radius:20px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:1.25rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
.workflow-info h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:1rem}
.workflow-info>p{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.workflow-benefits{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.65rem}
.workflow-benefits li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.workflow-benefits li::before{content:'✓';color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--accent-glow);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
.workflow-media{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem}

.workflow-snapshot{border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-secondary)}
.snapshot-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.snapshot-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
.snapshot-dot.r{background:#ff5f57}.snapshot-dot.y{background:#ffbd2e}.snapshot-dot.g{background:#28c840}
.snapshot-title{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.7rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-left:.5rem}
.snapshot-body{padding:1.5rem;min-height:180px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.simple-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.flow-step{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:.6rem .9rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;transition:all .3s}
.flow-step:hover{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 15px var(--accent-glow)}
.flow-step-icon{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;flex-shrink:0}
.flow-connector{color:var(--accent);font-size:1rem;opacity:.5}

.workflow-video{border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-secondary)}
.video-placeholder{aspect-ratio:16/9;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.video-placeholder::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,229,160,.05),transparent)}
.video-placeholder:hover{background:var(--bg-card)}
.play-btn{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .3s;box-shadow:0 0 30px var(--accent-glow-strong)}
.play-btn svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:var(--bg-primary);margin-left:3px}
.video-placeholder:hover .play-btn{transform:scale(1.1);box-shadow:0 0 50px var(--accent-glow-strong)}
.video-label{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-dim);font-weight:500}

.results{background:var(--bg-secondary)}
.results-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}
.result-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;text-align:center;transition:all .4s}
.result-card:hover{border-color:var(--border-accent);transform:translateY(-4px)}
.result-number{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.result-label{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5}

.testimonials-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:2rem;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.testimonial-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:2.25rem;transition:all .4s}
.testimonial-card:hover{border-color:var(--border-accent);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.testimonial-stars{color:#fbbf24;font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:1rem}
.testimonial-text{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.5rem;font-style:italic}
.testimonial-author{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem}
.testimonial-avatar{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-glow),var(--bg-secondary));border:1px solid var(--border-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1rem}
.testimonial-name{font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
.testimonial-role{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-dim)}

.cta-section{text-align:center}
.cta-box{max-width:750px;margin:0 auto;padding:4rem 3rem;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg-card),rgba(0,229,160,.04));border:1px solid var(--border-accent);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cta-box::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-50%;left:-50%;width:200%;height:200%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,var(--accent-glow) 0%,transparent 50%);opacity:.3;animation:rotateCTA 15s linear infinite}
@keyframes rotateCTA{from{transform:rotate(0)}to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.cta-box h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.5rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.cta-box p{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 2rem;position:relative;z-index:1;line-height:1.7}
.cta-box .btn-primary{position:relative;z-index:1;font-size:1rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem}

footer{position:relative;z-index:1;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:3rem}
.footer-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.footer-copy{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-dim)}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:2rem;list-style:none}
.footer-links a{color:var(--text-dim);text-decoration:none;font-size:.8rem;transition:color .3s}
.footer-links a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

@media(max-width:900px){
  nav{padding:1rem 1.5rem}
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .hero-stats{gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .workflow-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .workflow-card.reverse{direction:ltr}
  .footer-inner{flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}
  .testimonials-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:all .7s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="grid-bg"></div>

<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo"><div class="nav-logo-icon">⚡</div><span>AirSync Systems</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#pain-points">The Problem</a></li>
    <li><a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
    <li><a href="#automations">Automations</a></li>
    <li><a href="#results">Results</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Book a Free Audit</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-tag">Built for Home Service Businesses</div>
  <h1>Your Office Runs Itself While <span class="accent-text">You Run Jobs</span></h1>
  <div class="hero-industries">
    <div class="industry-pill"><span class="pill-icon">🔧</span> Plumbing</div>
    <div class="industry-pill"><span class="pill-icon">🏠</span> Roofing</div>
    <div class="industry-pill"><span class="pill-icon">❄️</span> HVAC</div>
  </div>
  <p>AirSync builds smart automations that handle your calls, scheduling, follow-ups, invoicing, and reviews — so you can stop drowning in admin work and start growing your business.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#automations" class="btn-primary">See How It Works</a>
    <a href="#results" class="btn-secondary">View Results</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="hero-stat"><div class="number">15+</div><div class="label">Hours Saved Weekly</div></div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><div class="number">3x</div><div class="label">Faster Lead Response</div></div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><div class="number">40%</div><div class="label">Revenue Increase</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pain-points" id="pain-points">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <div class="section-tag">Sound Familiar?</div>
    <h2>You're Losing Money Every Day to Manual Busywork</h2>
    <p>If any of these hit home, we can help. These are the exact problems our automations are built to eliminate.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pain-grid">
    <div class="pain-card reveal">
      <div class="pain-icon">📞</div>
      <h3>Missed Calls = Missed Jobs</h3>
      <p>You're on a roof or under a sink when a new customer calls. By the time you call back, they already booked your competitor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-card reveal">
      <div class="pain-icon">📋</div>
      <h3>Scheduling Chaos</h3>
      <p>Double-booked techs, forgotten appointments, and customers left waiting. Your calendar is a mess and it's costing you reviews.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-card reveal">
      <div class="pain-icon">💸</div>
      <h3>Chasing Payments</h3>
      <p>Jobs are done but invoices sit unsent for days. When they finally go out, you're following up manually just to get paid.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-card reveal">
      <div class="pain-icon">⭐</div>
      <h3>Zero Review Strategy</h3>
      <p>Happy customers walk away and never leave a review. Unhappy ones post one-star reviews you don't see until it's too late.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how-it-works">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <div class="section-tag">Our Process</div>
    <h2>Simple Setup, Powerful Results</h2>
    <p>We handle everything. You don't need to be tech-savvy — just tell us how your business runs and we'll do the rest.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step-card reveal">
      <div class="step-number">01</div>
      <div class="step-icon">🔍</div>
      <h3>We Learn Your Business</h3>
      <p>We hop on a call and walk through your day-to-day — how you get leads, book jobs, dispatch your crew, and collect payment. We find every spot where time and money are slipping away.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card reveal">
      <div class="step-number">02</div>
      <div class="step-icon">🛠️</div>
      <h3>We Build Your Automations</h3>
      <p>We design smart automations custom-fit to your business — connecting the tools you already use. No cookie-cutter templates. Everything is tailored to how your team actually works.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card reveal">
      <div class="step-number">03</div>
      <div class="step-icon">🚀</div>
      <h3>We Launch & Support You</h3>
      <p>We turn everything on, walk your team through it, and keep an eye on performance. As your business grows, we fine-tune everything so it keeps up with demand.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="automations" style="background:var(--bg-secondary)">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <div class="section-tag">What We Automate</div>
    <h2>See Exactly How It Works</h2>
    <p>Each automation below runs in the background 24/7 — handling the tasks that used to eat up your entire day. Watch the demos to see them in action.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-section">

    <!-- 1: Lead Capture -->
    <div class="workflow-card reveal">
      <div class="workflow-info">
        <div class="workflow-badge">Never Miss a Lead</div>
        <h3>Instant Lead Capture & Follow-Up</h3>
        <p>When a new customer reaches out — whether it's a form on your website, a Facebook message, or a Google ad click — they get an instant response. The system captures their info, figures out what service they need, and texts your team so someone can follow up while the lead is still hot.</p>
        <ul class="workflow-benefits">
          <li>Responds to new leads within 30 seconds — even at midnight</li>
          <li>Automatically figures out what service the customer needs</li>
          <li>Sends your team a text with all the customer details</li>
          <li>Saves the customer info so nothing ever gets lost</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-media">
        <div class="workflow-snapshot">
          <div class="snapshot-header"><span class="snapshot-dot r"></span><span class="snapshot-dot y"></span><span class="snapshot-dot g"></span><span class="snapshot-title">Automation Preview</span></div>
          <div class="snapshot-body">
            <div class="simple-flow">
              <div class="flow-step"><div class="flow-step-icon" style="background:#4353ff">🌐</div>Customer Reaches Out</div>
              <div class="flow-connector">→</div>
              <div class="flow-step"><div class="flow-step-icon" style="background:#ff6d00">🤖</div>Instant Response</div>
              <div class="flow-connector">→</div>
